<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TIG Holdings lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TIG Holdings lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it lowered its near-term rating on TIG Holdings Inc to accumulate from buy and left unchanged the long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/8 to 28-1/4 in morning New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
